{"unit_id":"g-yixuan__dsh-sidenote#readme-1","repo":"g-yixuan/dsh-sidenote","commit":"5f5a9d46ecfaaa771d2d4a2f4e0a4e9ac8ba79e6","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sidenote README · Introduction：<p align=\"center\">\n  <picture>\n    <source media=\"(max-width: 640px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/hero-compact.svg\">\n    <img src=\"docs/assets/hero.svg\" alt=\"dsh-sidenote：思路可以分岔，主线始终向前。划选注释、侧边追问，再把结论带回来。\" width=\"100%\">\n  </picture>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  为 <b>DeepSeek Harness</b> 加上侧边聊天与划选注释。<br>\n  读到一个疑问，就在旁边聊透；有了结论，再带回正在推进的任务。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"#安装\">安装</a> ·\n  <a href=\"#看看它如何工作\">功能演示</a> ·\n  <a href=\"docs/usage.md\">使用指南</a> ·\n  <a href=\"README_EN.md\">English</a>\n</p>","source":"extracted","section":"Introduction"}
